<%# A BRAND PAGE'S HEADER (logos/show and logos/motion): the engine page header (studio-engine
    docs/PAGE_HEADER.md), then the kit's save line and Context under it.

    The row: the crumb trail (Admin › Logos, the Logos crumb carrying the page's context, colouring and
    download format: logo_crumbs), the brand's name as the page's one h1, and the type tabs (Icon, Navbar
    Logo, Stacked Logo, then Motion; task logo-motion-presets) as the header's tabs: views of the same kit.
    Context is a form that sets the page's theme, which fits none of the header's four kinds of control, so
    it stands on the line under the row, beside the kit's save line.

    Locals: name (the brand's name), keep (optional: the params the Context form carries; the tab's
    logo_page_params unless given), status_href (optional: where the save line goes; the Kit card on this
    page unless given). %>
<% tabs = Logos::Variant::TYPES.map do |type, label|
     { label: label, href: logo_brand_path(@logo.brand, logo_page_params(type: (type unless type == :navbar))),
       current: ("page" if type == @type), data: { test: "logo-tab", type: type } }
   end %>
<%# The Motion tab plays the kit's own logo in a motion preset; it carries only the page's context and colouring. %>
<% tabs << { label: "Motion", href: logo_brand_path(@logo.brand, logo_page_keeps.merge(type: :motion)),
             current: ("page" if @type == :motion), data: { test: "logo-tab", type: "motion" } } %>
<%= render "studio/page_header", title: name, crumbs: logo_crumbs,
      label: "Logo type", tabs: tabs, tabs_data: { test: "logo-tabs" }, data: { test: "logo-header" } %>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2" data-test="logo-header-bar">
  <p class="text-2xs text-muted min-w-0 mr-auto" data-test="kit-status"><%= link_to logo_kit_status(@kit_record, @savers), local_assigns[:status_href] || "#kit", class: "hover:text-primary", title: logo_kit_status(@kit_record, @savers, full: true) %></p>
  <%= render "logos/context_form", url: logo_brand_path(@logo.brand), keep: local_assigns[:keep] %>
</div>
